# Lean TypeScript rules

- Use this file plus `01-modern-javascript.mdc` as the default coding standard.
- For topic-specific guidance, read only the indexed skill docs in `06-skills-source-index.mdc`.
- Prefer correctness first, then readability, then minimal complexity.
- Keep changes small and local; avoid abstractions without clear benefit.
- Prefer narrowing and explicit guards over assertions.
- Prefer `unknown` over `any` at boundaries and validate external input early.
